1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
[Music]
[音乐]

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,840
For a whole year, I've been following a remarkable family of baby elephants in Kenya.
一整年,我一直跟随肯尼亚一个出色的婴儿大象家庭.

3
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,000
[Music]
[音乐]

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,440
A family of elephants raised by people.
由众生养大象眷属.

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:22,480
Everyone of these little elephants is an orphan, rescued from the wild having lost their mother.
这些小象中的每一个人都是孤儿,在失去母亲后从野外救出.

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,240
They've all been brought to a unique nursery in Nairobi,
他们都被带到了内罗毕独一无二的托儿所

7
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,920
where they receive the intense love and care that they desperately need.
在那里,他们得到了强烈的爱和关怀 他们迫切需要。

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:35,840
[Music]
[音乐]

9
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:39,600
All of these babies have been saved from certain death in the wild,
所有这些婴儿都从野外的死亡中拯救出来

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,840
by the vision of one woman, Daphne Sheldon.
一个女人,达芙妮・谢尔顿

11
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:46,800
Together with her team of dedicated keepers,
与她的团队 忠诚的守护者,

12
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:52,000
she's giving orphaned baby elephants a second chance for a normal life in the wild,
她给孤儿大象第二次机会 在野外过正常生活,

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,560
where they belong.
他们属于的地方。

14
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,240
By the time they're two years old, the young babies are ready to leave the
等他们两岁了,小宝宝就准备离开

15
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:01,120
security of the nursery and are brought here.
托儿所的保安人员被送到这里

16
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:05,360
This is Savo National Park and we're about 350 kilometres east
这里是萨沃国家公园 我们东边约350公里

17
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:08,080
of where Michaela is at the Nairobi orphanage.
麦可拉在内罗毕孤儿院

18
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:12,880
And I've been following the older orphans as they make their long and difficult journey
我跟着那些年长的孤儿 踏上了漫长而艰难的旅程

19
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,120
back into the wild.
回到了野外。

20
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:19,920
Yesterday on Elephant Diaries, the convoy carrying six orphaned baby elephants
昨天在大象日记上 车队载着六只孤儿大象

21
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:25,200
to their new life in Savo, was forced to stop when one of the elephants began to panel.
在Savo的新生活, 当其中一只大象开始面板时, 被迫停止。

22
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:33,040
How do you help them?
你怎么帮他们?

23
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:37,040
They're getting so agitated that they've begun to choke
他们太激动了 开始窒息

24
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:39,840
and that's putting people's life in danger.
这会把人们的生命置于危险之中

25
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:50,880
[Music]
[音乐]

26
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,400
That's so passionate.
这太热情了

27
00:01:52,400 --> 00:02:05,600
Oh my goodness, this is awful.
哦,我的上帝,这是可怕的。

28
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:12,080
[Music]
[音乐]

29
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:19,920
[Music]
[音乐]

30
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:24,080
We just checked the keeper out and he is okay but it's so surprising that it's
我们刚刚检查了守门员 他没事,但很意外

31
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,280
Neposia that has completely freaked out.
完全吓坏了的内波西亚

32
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:31,200
Neposia always seems so calm.
Neposia总是这么平静.

33
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:37,760
Quick thinking has saved the lives of the keepers trapped inside the truck.
快速思维拯救了被困在卡车内的看守人员的生命.

34
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:41,120
And everyone hopes that the distraction of freshly cut food
每个人都希望, 分散食物的注意力

35
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:45,840
will help little Neposia deal with the trauma of this journey.
帮助小纳波西亚 应对这次旅程的创伤

36
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:49,120
Although it's very stressful for everyone involved,
虽然这对每个参与其中的人来说都是压力很大,

37
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:53,360
we all hope it will be worth it.
我们都希望这是值得的。

38
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:57,360
The six little orphans in these trucks are part of a new venture.
这些卡车上的六个小孤儿是新冒险的一部分.

39
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,400
They're destined to form a new orphan herded at Thumba,
他们注定要在Thumba组建一个新的孤儿群,

40
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,760
a new release site in a remote corner of Savo.
在萨沃的偏僻角落里一个新的发布站点.

41
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,680
John, we're up again, are we?
约翰,我们又起来了,是吗?

42
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:09,520
Okay.
好吧,我告诉你。

43
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:14,560
It's going to be an enormous challenge but if all goes well the hope is that over
这将是一个巨大的挑战 但如果一切顺利的希望是结束

44
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:19,920
the coming years they will gradually return to Living Wild.
在未来的岁月里,他们将逐渐返回野生。

45
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:32,320
[Music]
[音乐]

46
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:35,920
This is going to be such a surprise for all of the orphans.
这对所有孤儿来说都是个惊喜。

47
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,080
This vegetation is very different tonight.
今晚的植被很不一样

48
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,000
I really think it's a lot drier for a star.
我真的觉得这对明星来说更干燥.

49
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:44,000
There's not as many nights juicy green bushes.
没有那么多的夜晚多汁的绿色灌木丛。

50
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,600
So, I hope they're going to like their new home.
我希望他们会喜欢他们的新家

51
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:51,040
[Music]
[音乐]

52
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:55,920
On Vodar convoy is Wendy, the mini matriarch of the nursery babies.
在Vodar车队是Wendy, 婴儿的小型母校。

53
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,560
Although Nairobi is now far behind us,
虽然内罗毕现在远远落后于我们,

54
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,880
I can't help thinking about the nursery and the four
我忍不住想着托儿所和四个

55
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:04,240
leaderless little elephants we left behind.
我们留下的无头小象

56
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:08,800
Everyone's worried that losing Wendy will make them feel extremely unsettled.
每个人都担心失去温蒂会让他们感到极度不安.

57
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,160
Headkeeper Edwin has been keeping a close eye on them.
守门员埃德温一直密切关注着他们

58
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:15,280
All the young ones are very,
所有年轻人都非常

59
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:18,800
very much scared after all the big ones have left.
在那些大块头离开后,非常害怕

60
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,680
[Music]
[音乐]

61
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:24,800
Dhammatri is showing some signs of difficulty.
Dhammatri表现出了一些困难的迹象。

62
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,560
He does not want to come to the keepers.
他不想去看守者那里

63
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:31,600
He does not want to go to the other three who are upset or down.
他不想去另外三个人那里,他们心烦意乱。

64
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:35,600
Dhammatri is doing all these because he was very much close to Wendy
Dhammatri之所以这么做 是因为他非常接近Wendy

65
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,680
and he took Wendy as the mother.
他以温蒂为母亲.

66
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:44,400
And even at night he wanted to sleep with Wendy.
即使晚上他也想和温蒂上床

67
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:48,400
[Music]
[音乐]

68
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:54,880
But we hope after a short time he will come to town with that.
但我们希望他不久后会带着这个来镇上。

69
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:59,680
Wendy is not there and he has to cope with the other three
Wendy不在 他必须应付其他三个

70
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,840
and be close to the keepers.
且亲近守护者.

71
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:06,080
All Edwin and the keepers can do is offer love and comfort
爱德温和守护者所能做的 就是提供爱和安慰

72
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:20,640
but no one really knows if he will ever be able to cope with his new loss.
但没人知道 他能否应付新的损失

73
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:26,080
This is Voi in the south of Sarvo and most of the young elephants here
这是萨沃南部的沃伊 和这里的大部分年轻大象

74
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:28,560
came from the Nairobi nursery.
来自于内罗毕托儿所。

75
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:33,040
Now they're learning what it takes to go back to the wild.
现在他们学着回野外需要什么

76
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:37,200
For the time being at least this herd still has its matriarch
至少暂时这群人还有母权

77
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:42,640
a 10-year-old orphan called Emily but they're also facing major changes.
10岁的孤儿叫艾米莉 但他们也面临着重大的变化

78
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:45,600
The Sarvo herd has grown enormously from just a few individuals.
萨沃牧群从几个人那里大为发展。

79
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:50,080
There's now 30 and so it's been decided to actually split the herd up.
现在已经有30个了 所以决定把牛群实际分开

80
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:53,680
Four females have been selected for a very special job
四名女性被选中从事非常特殊的工作

81
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:57,520
helping the six orphans with Michaela cope in their new home.
帮助6个孤儿 与迈克尔拉 应付他们的新家庭。

82
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:00,320
The plan is that they'll lead the new orphan herd
计划是他们带领新的孤儿群

83
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:08,400
and in time one of them will rise to the challenge and become the new matriarch.
他们中有一个会面对挑战,成为新的母权主义者。

84
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:11,200
These older more experienced elephants here in Voi
这些更老的老象在沃伊

85
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:14,720
are about to be taken north to the new release sighted at Thumba
即将被带往北边的Thumba新释放地点

86
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:21,840
to join up with the little ones already on their way there from Nairobi.
和那些已经从内罗毕过来的小家伙们一起

87
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:26,160
So as Emily leads the others out for the day
所以当艾米丽带领其他人出去一天

88
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:32,720
the four chosen females have been left behind in preparation for the big move.
4个被选中的雌性 被留下来准备大动作

89
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:37,520
Now these are our four girls that are going to go north up to a Thumba
现在这四个女孩要北上通巴

90
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:41,760
and they've been kept back for the moment so the rest of the herds already gone out to feed
他们暂时被挡在后面 所以其他的牧群已经出去喂食了

91
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,720
but we've put some treats just down there at that concrete ramp.
但我们在混凝土坡道上放了些药

92
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,800
That's where the trucks are going to come to
卡车就要去那儿

93
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:51,200
just to get them used to the idea of going down there.
让他们习惯去那儿

94
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:56,000
Among their favourite treats is a brown powder called copper.
他们最喜欢的治疗包括一种叫铜的棕色粉末.

95
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:00,320
And the copra, what actually is that? What's in copra?
还有椰子,那是什么? 咖啡馆里有什么?

96
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,480
The copra is coconut.
椰子是椰子.

97
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:07,280
It's coconut, which has got a lot of nutrients so that's really good for them.
这是椰子,它有 大量的营养,这样对他们真的很好。

98
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:10,800
So it's not just a treat, it's actually also very good with the young elephants.
所以这不仅仅是一个招待, 实际上它也是非常好的 对年轻的大象。

99
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:13,760
Well they obviously like it. Have you ever tried it?
他们显然喜欢 你试过吗?

100
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,000
Should we see what it's like?
我们应该看看是什么样子吗?

101
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,760
The difference.
差别.

102
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,240
Is it good?
好吃吗?

103
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:26,000
It has to be very little. Actually that's pretty good.
它必须非常少。 实际上,这是相当不错的。

104
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:33,680
This is a real treat for them and it's all part of this process of just trying to get
对他们来说,这是真正的好东西, 这些都是这个过程的一部分,只是试图得到

105
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:37,360
them used to the idea that it's okay to be coming here that this is
他们习惯于这样的想法: 来这里是好的

106
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:41,200
not something for them to be nervous about. Isn't it?
不是让他们紧张的东西。 是吗?

107
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:46,000
Yeah. This is Kinna, you can see with that sunburned ear.
对 这是金娜,你可以看到 太阳灼伤的耳朵。

108
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,760
The tops of her ears were severely burnt when she was a baby.
她小时候耳朵的顶部被严重烧伤。

109
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:55,680
She'd lost her family and was stuck for days in mud out in the scorching sun.
她失去了家人 被困在焦燥的阳光下

110
00:07:55,680 --> 00:08:04,560
Oh no, she's decided that she will take that was a gift Kinna.
哦,不,她决定 她会接受一个礼物金娜。

111
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,520
You're not limited to that.
你并不限于这个

112
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,520
Oh great, thank you very much.
太好了,非常感谢.

113
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:13,600
Okay that's enough, I think we should be following the rest of the herd again out there
好了,够了,我想我们应该 跟着其余的牧群再次在那里。

114
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:16,240
where the real grub is. Come on you lot, let's go.
真正的阴茎在哪里。 来吧,伙计们,我们走。

115
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,880
Okay, have you got our four ellies used to the loading ramp,
好了,你有我们四个精灵 习惯装载坡道,

116
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:23,840
they can rejoin Emily and the rest of their chons.
他们可以重新加入Emily 和他们剩下的战友

117
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:26,000
Hey, thanks come family now, what are you doing Emily?
嘿,谢谢你的家人了,你在做什么艾米丽?

118
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:30,880
That real sort of jaunty bouncy movement there.
那种真正的强力运动

119
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:33,920
Hello Emily.
你好,艾米丽。

120
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:42,560
Emily. Emily.
艾米丽。 艾米丽。

121
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:45,360
No Emily, that's not for you.
不,艾米丽,这不是给你的。

122
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,480
Joseph, did you ask me?
约瑟夫,你问我吗?

123
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,560
Actually, yeah, she's going to, I think she might damage it.
其实,是的,她要去, 我想她可能会破坏它。

124
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:58,160
I don't know, I think maybe she's uh, listen, you see here now.
我不知道,我想也许她 呃,听着,你看这里。

125
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:03,040
It's the other four and Emily's talking to them.
是其他四个和艾米莉在和他们说话

126
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,680
Even with her back turn, she knew they were there.
即使她转身,她知道他们在那里。

127
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:10,800
This is actually going to be the last time that they will join the herd of a morning.
这是他们最后一次加入早晨的牧群。

128
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:17,760
See that excitement now, they're coming back.
看到现在的兴奋, 他们回来了.

129
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:29,200
Emily's helped teach these four everything they know.
艾米莉帮助教导了这四个他们知道的一切.

130
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:32,560
The gamble is, will they take that knowledge with them to a thumber?
赌博是,他们会把知识 与他们一起到拇指?

131
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:37,360
The future of the new herd depends on it.
新群的未来取决于它。

132
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:40,000
Problem is, none of them is more than five years old,
问题是,他们都没有超过5岁,

133
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,520
and by Ellie's standards that makes them still young children.
并且根据艾莉的标准 让他们还年轻的孩子。

134
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:46,640
So none of us know if the move will be successful.
因此,我们没有人知道这一举动是否会成功。

135
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:52,000
With all six little orphans from Nairobi still on board,
内罗毕的六个孤儿都还在船上

136
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,440
we're approaching their new home.
我们正在接近他们的新家

137
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:56,320
It's the long way north of where Jonathan is.
这是乔纳森所在的远北路.

138
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:19,440
We've been driving seven hours and we've just gone through the gates of Sarvo National Park.
我们开了7个小时的车 刚从萨尔沃国家公园的大门走出来

139
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:23,120
We've still got a little bit further to go because we're going to a thumber,
我们还有一点工作要做,因为我们要去一个拇指,

140
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,600
which is in the north part of East Sarvo.
它位于东萨尔沃北部

141
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:29,600
It's been very hot, it's been bumpy, it's been long.
一直很热,很颠簸,很长一段时间.

142
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:32,480
Hopefully our elephants are going to be okay.
希望我们的大象没事

143
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:35,200
It must be incredibly stressful for them.
对他们来说一定压力很大

144
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,280
There's also been a very noisy journey,
还有一段很吵的旅程,

145
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,760
but this is just a few hours in their life,
但这只是他们生命中的几个小时,

146
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:44,240
so hopefully it won't be long before they realize it's a long journey as well.
希望不会太久 他们才意识到那也是漫长的旅程

147
00:10:44,240 --> 00:11:05,040
This is a thumber, the new release site in journey's end for our six little enemies.
这是一个缩略语,新的发布网站 在旅程的尽头 我们的六个小敌人。

148
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:18,640
Eight hours later, we finally arrived.
8小时后,我们终于到了。

149
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:23,200
Hello gorgeous, this is the Ellie's new home.
你好,美女,这是艾莉的新家

150
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,840
It's the first time they will have seen it.
这是他们第一次看到它。

151
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:28,400
And I hope they're all right.
我希望他们没事

152
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:38,400
They're so desperate to get out of the truck
他们急着要下车

153
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,480
that they've jammed the door catch,
他们把门堵住了

154
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,240
unless the keepers can get the door open
除非守门人打开门

155
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,560
and the passion could hurt themselves trying to climb out.
激情会伤害自己 试图爬出来。

156
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:55,840
But once the gates are opened,
但一旦城门打开

157
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:59,280
our excited more orphans can take their first steps to freedom.
我们激动的更多孤儿 可以采取他们的第一步 自由。

158
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:08,400
Everyone has arrived safely and moments later,
每个人都安全到达了 稍后,

159
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,240
Wendy and the others following a pasture.
温蒂和其他人跟着牧场

160
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:16,720
One by one, the babies experience the strange sight,
一个接一个的,婴儿 经历奇怪的视觉,

161
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:20,480
sounds and smells of their new home for the very first time.
第一次听到和闻到他们的新家

162
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:40,560
These elephants are so relieved to get out of those trucks
这些大象从卡车上出来,真是轻松

163
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:44,240
and they're so hot and this is the perfect way to pull down.
他们太热了,这是拉下来的最好方法。

164
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,560
And you know what, I've done a sour journey.
你知道,我做了一个酸的旅程。

165
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:48,320
I feel like I want to join them.
我觉得我想加入他们

166
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,920
Hey, come on, come on.
嘿,来吧,来吧。

167
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:53,840
After an extremely long and hard day,
经过漫长而艰难的一天

168
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:56,720
this mud wallow must be a very welcome release.
这个泥墙一定是非常受欢迎的释放

169
00:12:56,720 --> 00:13:01,200
But the long journey was worth it,
但漫长的旅程值得

170
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:04,000
because these six little ones are now one step closer
因为这六个小的现在更接近了

171
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,080
to living wild and free once again.
{\fn黑体\fs22\bord1\shad0\3aHBE\4aH00\fscx67\fscy66\2cHFFFFFF\3cH808080}再过一次自由的生活 {\fn黑体\fs22\bord1\shad0\3aHBE\4aH00\fscx67\fscy66\2cHFFFFFF\3cH808080}我很高兴

172
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:10,800
With the young elephants starting to relax,
随着年轻的大象们开始放松

173
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:13,680
the trucks head off to collect the four older females,
卡车开过去接那四个老女人

174
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,760
who we hope will be joining us very soon.
我们希望他们能很快加入我们。

175
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:19,360
Meanwhile, back at the Nairobi nursery,
同时,回到内罗毕托儿所

176
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:22,640
the four babies we left behind are still slightly subdued.
我们留下的4个婴儿 仍然稍有屈从.

177
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:25,520
It's hard for them,
对他们来说很难

178
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,600
but slowly they seem to be coming to terms
但慢慢地,他们似乎 到了条件

179
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:30,720
with the fact that Wendy, their mini matriarch has gone.
温蒂 他们的小母狗走了

180
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,600
They're obviously feeling very insecure
他们明显感到很不安全

181
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:36,080
and are sticking close to Edwin and the other keepers.
并且紧贴着埃德温和其他守护者

182
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:40,800
But luckily little Domotas finally calmed down
但幸运的是,小多摩塔斯终于平静下来了

183
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:44,000
and seems resigned to the fact that Wendy is no longer there.
{\fn黑体\fs22\bord1\shad0\3aHBE\4aH00\fscx67\fscy66\2cHFFFFFF\3cH808080}而且似乎对Wendy已经不在了

184
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:52,880
Even so, at the end of the day, as all the babies head off to bed,
即使这样,在一天结束时, 当所有的婴儿都去睡觉,

185
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:56,640
he can't help making one final check that she's not hiding somewhere.
他不能不做一个最后的检查 她没有躲在什么地方。

186
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,200
Before running to catch up with the others.
在跑去追赶其他人之前.

187
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:14,400
Once home, all the babies settle down,
一旦回家,所有的婴儿都安顿下来,

188
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:18,800
safe in the knowledge that at least their human family are still there for them.
他们知道至少他们的人类家族 仍然在他们身边

189
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:50,320
The big days finally here, and the trucks have arrived from Thumba.
大日子终于到了,卡车从通巴运抵.

190
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:54,160
Just let's take a look at that, my goodness me.
让我们来看看,我的天啊。

191
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,840
Now, if that's one of the little ones
现在,如果这是一个小的

192
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,600
with Michaela can do and they're just two years old,
他们只有两岁,

193
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:02,960
I'm not looking forward to seeing what other ones are going to do.
我并不期待看到其他人会做什么

194
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,040
And they're much bigger.
而且它们大得多。

195
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:11,440
They can be the first elephants, but what will they do now?
他们可以成为第一批大象,但他们现在会做什么?

196
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:20,720
They're bound to remember having been in trucks before,
他们肯定记得以前在卡车上

197
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:23,680
so the keepers are reassuring them that everything's OK.
所以守护者们会向他们保证一切正常

198
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:28,720
Thank you.
谢谢

199
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:38,480
Go on girl, you can do it, look at that stretch.
去吧,女孩,你可以做到这一点, 看看拉伸。

200
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:41,200
She's determined only to go as far as she wants.
她决心只做她想做的事

201
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:46,000
They're going to push, no, no, no, not yet.
他们要推,不,不,还没有。

202
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:49,440
OK, she's in, she's in.
好吧,她进来了,她进来了。

203
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:54,960
The doors are shut.
门都关上了

204
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,160
OK, we've got two in.
好了,我们有两个进去。

205
00:15:56,160 --> 00:16:03,120
At least now we know that we're going to have two elephants going up to a Thumba
至少现在我们知道 两头大象要上通巴

206
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,920
to join those little ones, and that is so important.
加入那些小的, 这非常重要。

207
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:12,800
OK, here come the second two.
好了 后两个来了

208
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:25,040
Do you know that's interesting again, because this is Kenna,
你知道这又很有趣吗? 因为这是Kenna,

209
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,840
this one here with the damaged ear.
这只耳朵受损了

210
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:31,920
Kenna, at the moment, seems to be the most feisty,
肯娜,现在, 似乎是最勇敢的,

211
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:33,600
almost as if she's the leader.
好像她就是领导者一样

212
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,040
Will she be the new matron?
她会是新来的女主妇吗?

213
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:39,040
And if you look at her face, all elephants have a gland here,
如果你看着她的脸, 所有的大象都有一个腺,

214
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:43,200
a temporal gland, and she's secreting, tempering down her face.
一个时间腺, 她的分泌, 温柔下来她的脸。

215
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:45,520
And that's a sign perhaps that she's excited
这也许表明她很兴奋

216
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,520
that she's giving off messages to the others.
她正在给其他人发信息

217
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:49,520
Something's going on, and it's different.
某事不测,亦不同.

218
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:55,920
So far, neither of these two elephants have actually been right inside the trucks.
目前为止,这两头大象实际上都没有在卡车内部.

219
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:58,640
So we're going to keep this array.
所以我们要保留这个阵列。

220
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:08,080
Well, now what?
现在怎么办?

221
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:19,360
It's the first morning here at the new release site,
这是第一个早上 在新的发布网站,

222
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:22,320
and after the drama of yesterday's truck journey,
在昨天的卡车旅程之后

223
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:25,040
it's the first time our little Ellie's have had a chance
这是我们小艾莉第一次有机会

224
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,800
to explore their new surroundings.
探索他们的新环境.

225
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:29,840
But everything's so different.
但一切如来种种差别.

226
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:33,440
They must be feeling very scared and disorientated.
他们一定感到非常害怕和不安。

227
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:38,800
For Wendy and the orphans, today must be like starting a new school.
对于温蒂和孤儿来说,今天必须像开办新学校一样.

228
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:41,520
Everything's changed, nothing's familiar.
一切都变了 没什么是熟悉的

229
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:45,120
They're not really sure how to behave or what to do.
他们真的不知道如何行为或做什么。

230
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:48,560
In fact, the only things they're sticking to are the things they know,
事实上,他们唯一坚持的 就是他们知道的东西,

231
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:50,480
which are each other and the keepers.
他们是互相和监护的。

232
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:58,240
Our poor little orphans really do seem completely shell-shocked to be here.
我们可怜的小孤儿 似乎完全被震撼了

233
00:17:58,240 --> 00:18:03,920
And they're also very jumpy this morning.
今早他们也很兴奋

234
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:07,520
Any slight noise, the ears go up, the trunk goes up,
任何轻微的噪音,耳朵向上,树干向上,

235
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:09,520
and they're very pushy this morning as well.
今早他们也很冲动

236
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:16,480
Even greedy little on the pasture seems to be off his food.
草地上的小贪婪 似乎没有食物

237
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:21,280
But once he's more interested in seeking reassurance than filling his tummy.
但一旦他更有兴趣寻求保证 而不是填补他的肚子。

238
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:28,400
Now, one thing that's really quite worrying is that in just one day,
现在,有一件事 非常令人担心的是, 在一天之内,

239
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:31,280
these elephants have visibly lost weight.
这些大象明显减肥了

240
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:33,760
In Nairobi, they were really quite plump.
在内罗毕,它们非常丰满.

241
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:36,240
But if you look here, you can see it's quite sunken,
但是如果你看这里, 你可以看到它相当沉没,

242
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,160
and you can really see these hip bones.
你可以看到这些臀部骨骼。

243
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:40,080
Now, there are two reasons for that.
现在,有两个原因。

244
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:42,720
Yesterday they spent eight hours on a truck,
昨天他们在一辆卡车上花了8个小时

245
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:45,120
whereas normally they'd be grazing all day.
通常他们整天都在放牧

246
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:47,760
And once they got here, they were too stressed to eat.
一旦他们到了这里, 他们压力太大,不能吃饭。

247
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:51,680
Today, all this vegetation is new to them,
今天,这些植被对他们来说都是新的

248
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:54,640
and they're not really sure what they're supposed to be eating.
而且他们真的不知道 他们应该吃什么。

249
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:58,720
It's very difficult seeing them like this.
很难见到他们这样

250
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:03,440
Wendy's done all she can, but she's actually out of her depth here.
温蒂已经尽力了,但实际上她已经超出了她的深度.

251
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:07,760
They really need the leadership of the bigger elephants as soon as possible.
他们真的需要大象的领导 尽快。

252
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:22,800
We've managed to get the first two elephants in.
我们设法把头两头大象弄进来了

253
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:24,320
They hit the road an hour ago,
他们一小时前就上路了

254
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:27,360
but the last two are proving to be much more difficult.
但最后两个被证明是困难得多。

255
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:31,120
Convincing them to go in is going to be a lot tougher.
说服他们进去会更难

256
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:38,640
Now, whenever the elephants travel, there's always a vet with us.
现在,每当大象出行, 总是有一个兽医与我们.

257
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:43,520
That's actually trying to give them a sedative.
这其实是想给他们镇静剂

258
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:48,720
[Music]
[音乐]

259
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:52,240
Okay, they managed to inject one of them,
好吧,他们设法注射了一个,

260
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:55,600
but Kina has run away before they get empty the serene.
但是Kina在他们清空静地之前逃走了

261
00:19:55,600 --> 00:20:01,200
Kina is really upset now.
Kina现在很不高兴了

262
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,360
You can tell she's looking out of the corner of her eye.
你可以看到她正看着她的眼睛的角落。

263
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:06,480
She knows that something bad is going on behind her.
她知道她背后有坏事发生

264
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:11,840
[Music]
[音乐]

265
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:13,600
Now, did that work?
有用吗?

266
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:17,600
Oh, you know, I mean, that's just so ironic.
哦,你知道,我的意思是, 这太讽刺了。

267
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:19,840
It just went so well with those first two.
刚刚和前两个玩得很开心

268
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:23,920
I thought, yes, we're in, and maybe it'll just be easy,
我想,是的,我们进去了,也许这很简单,

269
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,680
but these actually are the older two.
但这些其实是老二。

270
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:29,040
And this is turning out to be much, much more difficult.
这更难解决。

271
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:33,600
I think the sedative is beginning to work.
我觉得镇静剂开始起作用了

272
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:37,120
So, Yata should be pretty much ready to go in.
亚塔应该已经准备好进去了.

273
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:42,560
She's just slowly, slowly relaxing.
她只是慢慢地,慢慢地放松。

274
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:47,840
But, Kina, I just don't know about you at all.
但是,基纳, 我只是一点都不了解你

275
00:20:47,840 --> 00:20:51,920
I bet all she wants right now is to be back with Emily.
我打赌她现在只想和艾米莉一起回来

276
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:56,960
[Music]
[音乐]

277
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:57,760
Here they go.
他们来了

278
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:59,200
They're going to try and get Yata in.
他们想让雅塔进来

279
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:03,680
This just shows you how powerful your young elephant is.
这说明你的年轻大象有多强大

280
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:10,880
Okay, go on, in you go, in you go, in you go.
好吧,继续,你走,你走,你走,你走。

281
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:15,360
Yes, yes, yes.
对,对,对。

282
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:27,360
Okay, three down, one to go.
好了,三个下来,一个去。

283
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:31,280
But I've got real doubts about Kina.
但我对Kina很怀疑

284
00:21:31,280 --> 00:21:33,440
I want to stand, see what happens to her,
我想站着 看看她会怎样

285
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,600
but I just can't afford to lose the others.
但我无法失去其他人

286
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:42,720
Off we go.
我们走了。

287
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:47,280
I've got a race to try and catch up with the others.
我有一个比赛 尝试赶上其他人。

288
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:48,640
They're way ahead by now.
他们已经领先了.

289
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:54,000
We've had to leave Kina behind.
我们不得不离开Kina。

290
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:56,000
I mean, she's been jabbed, she's had an injection,
我的意思是,她被刺伤, 她注射,

291
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:58,480
but whether they managed to get her into a truck or not
但他们是否设法让她上了卡车

292
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:01,920
and get her to a thumber, I just haven't got a clue.
带她去找个小指头 我只是不知道

293
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:04,400
I'll be amazed, to be honest, if they do.
老实说,我会惊讶的,如果他们这样做。

294
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:07,920
But, three elephants in trucks,
但是,三头大象在卡车上,

295
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:11,280
three elephants for those little babies from the Nairobi orphanage.
三头大象 给那些来自内罗毕孤儿院的婴儿

296
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:13,200
I mean, that is just so important.
我的意思是,这只是如此重要。

297
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,160
It's what it's all about.
即是所缘.

298
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:17,520
They need the security of a bigger elephant right now.
他们需要更大的大象的安全

299
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:19,680
They need a matriarch, somebody to rally around.
他们需要一个母权主义者, 有人聚集周围。

300
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:24,560
And the irony is, I was so sure that it was going to be Kina.
讽刺的是,我非常确定会是Kina。

301
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:28,160
To me, she seemed to be a leader, she was feisty,
在我看来,她似乎是一个领导者, 她充满活力,

302
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,920
she was always bellowing her head off.
她总是垂头丧气

303
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:32,400
